		<SimpleData name="has_remediation">0</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="guppy_notes">2006.071 Pine River oxbow Hwy 97 MoT S1 None No structure River oxbow cut off by highway fill. Deep, wide fill - Consider reconnecting oxbow inlet to river by oxbow major project to excavate. Old natural channel horizontal drilling to install tiers of culverts at 0% connection to river at UTM 543878 6162821. gradient for mid- to high water connectivity. A bridge or open-bottom arch would also work, but would have less control of the volume of water entering the oxbow and likely would cost much more.</SimpleData>
	</SchemaData></ExtendedData>
      <Point><coordinates>-122.305664,55.606309</coordinates></Point>
