		<SimpleData name="guppy_notes">2006.048 Silver Sands Hwy 97 MoT S2 EPA Outlet drop; Retrofitted with downstream weirs (partial barriers) Install a 16 m bridge, with 10+ m wide channel. Creek culvert width; and baffles (outlet baffle is partial barrier). Fish Reconstruct channel from downstream end of Culvert Length seen in pool below upper weir. Upper end of wieirs to well above culvert to remove barriers culvert filled with cobbles between baffles due to formed by weirs (see diagram). Stream too large bedload movement; lower end not filled with for anything except a bridge. See below further cobbles -- needs larger boulders to provide surface discussion and the stream profile. structure to replace that of the buried baffles. BT MW known.</SimpleData>
	</SchemaData></ExtendedData>
      <Point><coordinates>-122.558597,55.510785</coordinates></Point>
