		<SimpleData name="guppy_notes">2006.161 Sukunka River 200 MoF P3 RC Culvert width; Road fill failing near outlet. Culvert failing, needs Determine fish use. If there is fish use, install 18 m trib. Road km culvert slope; IMMEDIATE replacement -- top held up by interior bridge with 6+ m channel width. Remove upstream 70.4 outlet drop vertical braces (jacks). Sukunka River 30 m debris jam. Too much bedload and debris downstream, no barriers. Debris jam upstream. movement and streep gradient for an open-bottom Good connectivity with Sukunka River. arch.</SimpleData>
